dwelle","html_url":"https://github.com/dwelle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/36463966204/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/36463966204/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/check-suites/98736713591","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/36463966204/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/36463966204/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/36463966204/rerun","previous_attempt_url":null,"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/workflows/64850896","head_commit":{"id":"92d6010039fdce36c0a28ca82a4f3e63212cf2f8","tree_id":"ff5ecc5a1d0ef7eac77bfd471927926d9b4d9a43","message":"feat(editor): pan the canvas when the caret goes under the stats or styles panel\n\nThe canvas follows the caret past the view's edge, and behind the docked\nsidebar, through the editor's box, which the browser scrolls to reveal a\ncaret (#12175). The stats and the full styles panel don't span the box's\nheight, so a caret typed in under them stayed out of sight.\n\nAfter each input, once the update (and any scroll it made) is in the\napp's state, the editor works out where the caret is: its line from\n`getWrappedTextLines`, its x from the width of the line before it,\nrotated with the text. In a line with RTL characters (`hasRTLChars`, new\nin @excalidraw/common) the x comes from the browser's bidirectional\nlayout of the line instead, in its paragraph's direction (the editor's\n`dir=\"auto\"` makes it `unicode-bidi: plaintext`: each paragraph goes its\nfirst strong character's way): with Hebrew then English, the caret after\nthe English is mid-line, not at the line's edge. That's measured through\na range in an off-screen mirror of the line, shared with the\nclick-to-caret lookup. If the caret's under one of those panels, the\ncanvas pans to bring it out on the canvas' side, with\nCARET_FOLLOW_PADDING to spare. Only then: a text beside or below a panel\nstays where it is.\n\nTests: typing past the stats panel's left edge pans the canvas under it,\nbut not below it; the caret in a bidirectional line, a paragraph after\none going the other way, is found where the browser lays it out.\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 (1M), xhigh effort","timestamp":"2026-09-28T18:13:11Z","author":{"name":"dwelle","email":"5153846+dwelle@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"dwelle","email":"5153846+dwelle@users.noreply.github.com"}},"repository":{"id":231283452,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyMzEyODM0NTI=","name":"excalidraw","full_name":"excalidraw/excalidraw","private":false,"owner":{"login":"excalidraw","id":59452120,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjU5NDUyMTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59452120?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/excalidraw","html_url":"https://github.com/excalidraw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/excalidraw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/excalidraw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/excalidraw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/excalidraw/starred{/owner}{/r